@MobileBackEnd_HostAddress = http://localhost:5295
# ID token de Firebase del usuario (el app Flutter lo envía automáticamente)
@token = PEGA_AQUI_EL_ID_TOKEN

### Health check (sin token)
GET {{MobileBackEnd_HostAddress}}/api/health

### Solicitudes de sangre (filtra con ?bloodGroup=A+&status=Active)
GET {{MobileBackEnd_HostAddress}}/api/bloodrequests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mis solicitudes
GET {{MobileBackEnd_HostAddress}}/api/bloodrequests/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear solicitud (el solicitante sale del token)
POST {{MobileBackEnd_HostAddress}}/api/bloodrequests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientName": "Jorge Perez",
  "bloodGroup": "A+",
  "numberOfBags": 2,
  "contactNumber": "+18092249304",
  "caseDescription": "Accident",
  "needBeforeDate": "2026-12-01T00:00:00",
  "location": "Santo Domingo, RD"
}

### Cambiar estado (Active, Fulfilled, Cancelled)
PATCH {{MobileBackEnd_HostAddress}}/api/bloodrequests/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Fulfilled" }

### Donantes
GET {{MobileBackEnd_HostAddress}}/api/donors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrarme como donante
POST {{MobileBackEnd_HostAddress}}/api/donors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jorge Perez",
  "contactNumber": "+18092249304",
  "bloodGroup": "B+",
  "location": "Santo Domingo, RD"
}

### Mi perfil
GET {{MobileBackEnd_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
